  <div class="case-takeaway">
    <h3>Key takeaways</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="tone-junior">An agent's name isn't its interface — routing by name guesses what an agent can do instead of checking, and a wrong guess can fail silently.</div>
        <div class="tone-mid">Fetch the Agent Card at <code>/.well-known/agent-card.json</code> and match the task against its declared <code>skills</code> before routing anything to that agent.</div>
        <div class="tone-staff">Skill match and auth match are independent checks against the card's <code>skills</code> and <code>securitySchemes</code> — verify both, cache with a short TTL, and re-validate before anything security-sensitive.</div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
